* Save Structured (JSON) Results to RaceRoster.
*
*   When to use:    After the race to publish final structured results, or during the race for live updates.
*   How to use:     Double-click to upload all results to RaceRoster.
*
*   Setup:
*     Pass the RaceRoster sub-event ID and race code below.
*     Example (direct):  ResultsOnline.rsm   297655   5K
*     Example (Entries): ResultsOnline.rsm   %rr_5k%   5K
*
*   Recommendation:
*     - LPT live results use @ResultsLPTToRR, not this listing. Do not run both
*       against the same Race Roster result set. Define IDs in Entries.INI.

ResultsOnline.rsm   %rr_5k%   5K
ResultsOnline.rsm   %rr_10k%   10K
ResultsOnline.rsm   %rr_half%   HALF
